{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年42歲的韓國影視天后申敏兒早前榮升人妻後，近日飛抵法國巴黎出席LV時裝大騷。婚後的她依然明艷照人，凍齡美貌與優雅氣質再次成為全場鎂光燈焦點。</p><figure><img alt=\"申敏兒出席LV巴黎時裝大騷。（IG@illusomina）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184549044173672448498537.jpeg/12GnukC4M9gwN4y6KecJVUOayT9lxa5NJo9U7yaPVO8\"/><figcaption>申敏兒出席LV巴黎時裝大騷。（IG@illusomina）</figcaption></figure><p>42歲申敏兒亮相巴黎狀態大勇</p><p>申敏兒以一件黑白拼接外套上陣，內搭金屬感背心與腰帶，下半身則以俐落造型完美襯托出纖細身形，再配上一頭自然披肩的長捲髮，魅力十足。她對著鏡頭展露招牌笑容，一對標誌性的酒窩更是超級搶鏡。</p><figure><img alt=\"申敏兒以一件黑白拼接外套上陣狀態大勇。（IG@illusomina）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184549058791346176795216.jpeg/sC1M3o-2_11xHPxsp2CvD5AM5aADws9_7G3Mw-xtzMM\"/><figcaption>申敏兒以一件黑白拼接外套上陣狀態大勇。（IG@illusomina）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魅力十足。（IG@illusomina）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184549056387878912024785.jpeg/ce9es4sT2YGe0npzEo0CbqFHu1dEzY_WlmT2VJZk9lQ\"/><figcaption>魅力十足。（IG@illusomina）</figcaption></figure><p>與Felix驚喜同框，相差16歲零違和</p><p>申敏兒更與韓國人氣男團Stray Kids成員Felix（李龍馥）合照。一頭搶眼金髮的Felix身穿黑色短版西裝，散發出強烈的個人風格。申敏兒與年僅26歲的Felix足足相差16歲，但兩人並肩而立時竟然完全「零違和感」！面對青春無敵的偶像男神，申敏兒的氣場與美貌絲毫沒有被比下去。不少網民看完照片後都紛紛留言激讚：「完全唔似差16歲」、「女神真係食咗防腐劑」，果然是名副其實的「不老神話」。</p><figure><img alt=\"Stray Kids Felix（IG@yong.lixx）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184549702855561216431825.jpeg/bUdGZxg8VY8vbEjSoRJFoPjMB66sBrw2xfcBWMX3AVg\"/><figcaption>Stray Kids Felix（IG@yong.lixx）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同框Stray Kids成員Felix。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184549053963440128653071.jpeg/utYLZR4D-cX3_16ttBTBb9Ncxln28mVeKiHWNioh1jY\"/><figcaption>同框Stray Kids成員Felix。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩人相差16歲。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184550648641753088175693.jpeg/ZIgS8mzFAAAJiGVrJafwCEx19ftgzLlRTkJyiU5Ccok\"/><figcaption>兩人相差16歲。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民激讚申敏兒凍齡。（IG@wwdthailand）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261007/1184549049223614464302647.png/g1GNVdq7ijLzm_SmVDMhFc87U6whYadaG_CUaRvwlGk\"/><figcaption>網民激讚申敏兒凍齡。（IG@wwdthailand）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T15:21:06.377855+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":581,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}